      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should ask but i can't get an appointment for like two weeks and the pain is making it hard to sleep. it's just regular ibuprofen, not even a high dose. is it really that dangerous? i feel like i know my body and i haven't had any issues when I've taken them together in the past.",
